<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Multi Bintang first half net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Multi Bintang first half net down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	    (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    22.87    vs   24.57</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)     1,085    vs   1,166</p>
<p>    Net sales			    106.22    vs  100.72</p>
<p>    Gross profit			  55.24    vs   49.46</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    32.37    vs   30.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			32.43    vs   34.27</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  126.01    vs   104.32</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Multi Bintang Indonesia is the country's largest beer maker.</p>
